# Unit06
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit06核心词汇

born/bɔːrn/出生的；天生的/She was born in a small village.
borrow/ˈbɑːroʊ/借入/Can I borrow your pen for a moment?
boss/bɒs/老板；上司/My boss is very strict but fair.
both/boʊθ/两者都/Both of them passed the exam.
bother/ˈbɑːðər/打扰；麻烦/Don't bother me while I'm studying.
bottle/ˈbɑːtl/瓶子/He drank a whole bottle of water.
bottom/ˈbɑːtəm/底部；最低处/The keys are at the bottom of the bag.
bounce/baʊns/弹跳；反弹/The ball bounced off the wall.
bound/baʊnd/一定的；受约束的/He is bound to succeed with such effort.
boundary/ˈbaʊndri/边界；范围/The river forms the boundary between the two states.
bow/baʊ/鞠躬；弓/The audience gave a bow to the performers.
brain/breɪn/大脑；智力/The human brain is incredibly complex.
branch/bræntʃ/树枝；分支/The bank has branches all over the country.
brand/brænd/品牌；商标/This brand is very popular among young people.
brave/breɪv/勇敢的/She is a brave firefighter who saved many lives.
bread/bred/面包/She bought a loaf of bread from the bakery.
break/breɪk/打破；休息/He took a short break after two hours of work.
breakfast/ˈbrekfəst/早餐/I usually have breakfast at 7 a.m.
breath/breθ/呼吸/He took a deep breath before diving into the pool.
breathe/briːð/呼吸/It's hard to breathe at high altitudes.
breed/briːd/品种；繁殖/This breed of dog is very intelligent.
brick/brɪk/砖/The house was built of red brick.
bridge/brɪdʒ/桥梁；桥牌/The bridge connects the two sides of the river.
brief/briːf/简短的；简要的/He gave a brief summary of the meeting.
bright/braɪt/明亮的；聪明的/The bright sunshine lit up the room.
brilliant/ˈbrɪliənt/杰出的；灿烂的/She is a brilliant scientist.
bring/brɪŋ/带来/Please bring your textbooks to class.
broad/brɔːd/宽阔的；广泛的/The river is very broad at this point.
broadcast/ˈbrɔːdkæst/广播；播出/The news was broadcast live on TV.
brochure/ˈbroʊʃər/小册子/Pick up a brochure for more information.
broken/ˈbroʊkən/破碎的；损坏的/The broken window needs to be replaced.
brook/brʊk/小溪/A clear brook runs through the village.
brother/ˈbrʌðər/兄弟/My brother is two years older than me.
brush/brʌʃ/刷子；刷/She brushed her hair before going out.
budget/ˈbʌdʒɪt/预算/The government increased the education budget.
build/bɪld/建造；建立/They plan to build a new hospital here.
building/ˈbɪldɪŋ/建筑物/This building was constructed in the 19th century.
bulk/bʌlk/大量；大部分/The bulk of the work has been completed.
bullet/ˈbʊlɪt/子弹/The bullet missed him by inches.
bulletin/ˈbʊlətɪn/公告；简报/Check the bulletin board for the latest news.
burden/ˈbɜːrdn/负担；重担/He carried the burden of responsibility alone.
bureau/ˈbjʊroʊ/局；处/She works at the Federal Bureau of Investigation.
burn/bɜːrn/燃烧；烧伤/The fire burned for three hours.
burst/bɜːrst/爆炸；突然发生/The audience burst into laughter.
bury/ˈberi/埋葬；掩埋/The dog buried its bone in the garden.
bus/bʌs/公共汽车/She takes the bus to work every morning.
business/ˈbɪznəs/商业；生意/He started his own business at age 25.
busy/ˈbɪzi/忙碌的/I'm very busy with work this week.
but/bʌt/但是/I wanted to go, but I was too tired.
